<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-24T19:36:55.472Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 19:36:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces fired across the border into southern Syria, killing a disabled Syrian man in the Daraa buffer zone and deploying rooftop snipers who opened fire in the south. Syrian security officers were killed in a raid on an ISIL cell near Damascus, and further clashes occurred in Rankous and the Damascus countryside. Protesters gathered across Syria to denounce repeated Israeli incursions, while a road linking Damascus and Suwayda was blocked amid demands for detainees' release and the Sweida-Damascus highway was completely closed by outlaw groups. Arms depot explosions in Syria left 37 dead. 2732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNRzFxMmE4dWx3blk3Yy1MSGJTOXI4NC1URUM3OFBTdzdKUGRWWWRLLXl2bXJfNmoxLXJ6dmN3RFdmU0pRanZsN3dMXzZWaDRpbFhhdm1wanFDQ2FkdUxGcFoyaW41MjkwMER1RDVfRF9MLTgxcTlCMl9tTGgzOFNWV2NublFLUkM2VjBDU3A5Wm9SdVZfeEFyQlRjc09yc0pocTF1emZPMlJ2dVUzRkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFByX3hUSmJucGdmRFU0SlB0QVMxRElTeVotWVJKTGNUcEMwbHZHMzZobklOTTdBVGtiT2s1Z1BCOUtRRDJpbEFEMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPTmRkWmpfdGtZeGhnNkl3cnA5X1VMUnlJR3NMbVFGTWtQc2RJQ24wNUFFU3NFbWppczJKUEdoQUFkR1ZBeGotelFmMUJPNndveENhMGhaZFVOcFJucjJMeHQzaDhyLVlQUlNvOVUtbGZDNnhfRFp4cWdWZ21xVHJVRnFtTnlmZWEtQzVIOEE0SjFaV1h3MmZweTBuc1Z1UEh0S3BvTWdDZF9EdktwbnNWcjJSS1ZuM2JS?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Arab Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxObEZsLWFTMFI3OFFqQVhYOTdmX1hiQTZKTlJ2SHhTU2xwQkJIZHlCSlZuc3FRYXVRNzJRN1lyLUxHdU5YMHBKYXdzOWl5LVNQcHhWWXZObXNnMFBBWVpWR3ZtSHo2bzZRdUx6c1ZpU0JnVlpiUmlfaEVKVUJXR0lhaERWaHdrdnhiU0Vvd2VnRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre